      "name": "SEL-651R-2 Advanced Recloser Control",
      "summary": "<p>Use the SEL-651R for your most demanding recloser applications. The SEL-651R is a plug-compatible replacement for most Kyle/Cooper FXA, FXB, and Form 3, 3A, 4, 4A, 4C, 5, and 6 recloser controls. Built-in harmonic metering and voltage sag, swell, and interruption reporting help improve power quality.</p>",
